# Grand Pearl Marquee — environment configuration
#
# This project is a plain multi-folder repository with two independent
# applications: `server/` (Express backend) and `client/` (Vite frontend).
# There is no workspace/monorepo setup, so each app reads its own `.env`.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server (backend)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# The backend runs from the `server/` directory and reads its
# configuration from `server/.env`.
#
# To configure the backend:
#   1. cd server
#   2. cp .env.example .env
#   3. Fill in your values in server/.env
#
# The authoritative server template is server/.env.example.
# This root-level `.env` is NOT used by the backend.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client (frontend)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# The frontend reads build-time configuration from `client/.env`.
#
# To configure the client:
#   1. cd client
#   2. cp .env.example .env
#   3. Fill in your values in client/.env
#
# The client environment template is client/.env.example.
